        }
      ],
      "title": "#6 奇迹涂料"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3660001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "重物要砸下来了，不、不要啊……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "欸？！身体安然无恙，这……这里是？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我还被困在流水线内部的履带上！可是刚才的一切，竟然……都是回忆吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "皮肤！身体表层的皮肤！主人为优纪亲手涂上的颜料，被剥去了一部分！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "缓缓流动的流水线内部，只有冰冷而坚硬的履带声，在密闭黑暗的空间回响。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "之前在履带上，跟我相隔不远的那位大叔呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你可以说句话吗？前面、前面究竟怎么样了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你好……有人吗？请问有人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660010",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "滴，终端收来一条新信息。已读：2547，未读：236。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660011",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "滴，终端收来一条新信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660012",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "滴……滴滴滴滴滴……未读：240。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "终端上的信息！是主人发给优纪的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "都怪我不好，让主人担心了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "挣脱了这个！就、就能回复主人了！咦呀呀呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可恶，身体完全没有办法挣脱。你到底要把优纪带去什么地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在履带的传送下，很快来到了第二个「剥离装置」前。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不！求求你，不要啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "身体的涂料……脑袋！好痛啊啊啊啊——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "随着表层涂料的消失，「优纪」并没有露出寻常手办身体内的「白模」部分。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "取而代之的是内层斑驳的蓝色颜料，随着表面黄色涂料的消失，被越来越多的逐渐暴露在身体之上，",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "越来越多……越来越多回忆的画面……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "求求你……放开……我吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660025",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "终端收来一条新信息。已读：2547，未读：253。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660026",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "温馨提示，请您及时处理未读信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人……优纪好想你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3660028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊！脑袋好痛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
